1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,380
Good evening.

2
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,380
Good evening.

3
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,380
Good evening, Berkeley.

4
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,380
Good evening.

5
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:21,380
All right.

6
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,620
Welcome, welcome.

7
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:30,000
Before I begin my part, I want to kick us off by introducing

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,680
acknowledging some important leaders in our community

9
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:35,840
and thanking them for their work.

10
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:39,180
We'll start off Congresswoman Latifa Simon.

11
