Senator Jesse Arguin.

12
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,460
And you can raise your hand or stand or jump

13
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:54,060
or whatever you feel like doing, we love it.

14
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,820
Assemblymember Buffy Wicks.

15
00:00:55,820 --> 00:01:01,220
UC Berkeley Chancellor Rich Lyons.

16
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:07,060
City Auditor Jenny Wong.

17
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:15,180
Council members Kesarani,

18
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:21,620
Taplin, Bartlett, Tregeb, O'Keefe, Blackaby, Lunapara, and Humber.

19
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:22,920
Are you guys all?

20
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,920
Yeah.

21
00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:32,820
Our city manager, Paul Budahagen.

22
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:40,820
BUSD Superintendent, Anikia Ford-Morthell.

23
00:01:40,820 --> 00:01:46,820
Our school board members, Brown, Korn,

24
00:01:46,820 --> 00:01:53,820
Shinovsky, Chang, and Leyva Cutler.

25
00:01:53,820 --> 00:02:01,900
And our RENT board members, Alpert, Walker, Elkstrand, Johnson, Kelly, Marrero, Martinac,

26
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:03,180
Mizell, and Twu.

27
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:13,020
Though not everyone was able to join us tonight, we wanted to make sure that these folks were all

28
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:17,020
acknowledged, so thank you all for your work and for being here. What's that?

29
00:02:17,020 --> 00:02:21,060
There you are.

30
